WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.334
The robot arm moves towards the blue can on the right, grasps it, and lifts it. It then moves the can to the left and lowers it into the basket, releasing it inside.

2
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Move arm towards the blue can and grasp it

3
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Lift the can and move it to the left towards the basket

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Lower the can into the basket and release it

5
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Retract arm upwards and away from the basket
